  - title: 02 / Match the master
    explanation: Jog forward and compare signed counts. In SYNC, the master tracks
      the preset and the follower tracks measured master speed. Both motors must
      hold within the target band and within 2 RPM of each other.
    caption: "30 RPM  \u2022  60 RPM  \u2022  80 COUNTS PER REVOLUTION"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.12, y: 0.8}
      label: 5 V + RETURN
      color: {r: 0.28, g: 0.69, b: 1, a: 1}
