  - title: 03 / Recover under load
    explanation: Apply the test brake at steady 60 RPM. The follower slows. The governor
      raises follower duty and the web returns to its safe band when both rollers
      match again.
    caption: "FOLLOWER BRAKE  \u2022  WEB SLACK  \u2022  RECOVERY"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.12, y: 0.8}
      label: 5 V + RETURN
      color: {r: 0.28, g: 0.69, b: 1, a: 1}
