  - title: 04 / Repair reversed feedback
    explanation: Cross follower A and B at the controller and start the direction
      test. Three backward transitions with forward shaft motion stop both drives.
      Restore the wires, reset and synchronize at 60 RPM again.
    caption: "FORWARD SHAFT  \u2022  REVERSE COUNT  \u2022  SAFE STOP"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.12, y: 0.8}
